{"ID":"20240118151250-5lp5mp8","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151250-5lp5mp8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151250-5lp5mp8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151250-o7qwq2j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122105539-emzs5qi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122105539-emzs5qi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:360,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:360\u0026#125;","title":"101檗木（黄柏）","type":"doc","updated":"20240130092951"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151250-o7qwq2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151250-o7qwq2j","updated":"20240122104838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦寒，主五脏肠胃中结热，黄疸，肠痔，止泄利，女下漏下，赤白阴阳蚀疮。今名黄柏。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105012-7ddtsmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105012-7ddtsmi"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国四川，故亦称川柏，他处亦有之，日本输入者劣，树皮入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105502-dcvi7tc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105502-dcvi7tc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105503-xeykfh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105503-xeykfh6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】黄柏为除热杀虫，坚肾益阴要药，主结热，黄疸，诸痿，瘫痪，治诸疮痛，泄痢，下血，泻膀胱相火，疗淋浊白带，肠胃结热。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105505-04rbeo6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105505-04rbeo6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗惊气在皮间肌肤赤起，目热赤口疮。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105507-j5gh9bk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105507-j5gh9bk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】男子阴痿及传茎上疮，治下血如鸡鸭肝片。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105509-m0hsjwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105509-m0hsjwz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】热疮疱起，虫疮，血痢，止消渴，杀蛀虫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105510-ufltm62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105510-ufltm62"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【元素】泻膀胱相火，补肾水不足，坚肾壮骨髓，疗下焦虚，诸痿瘫痪，利下窍，除热。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105512-jodpqsu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105512-jodpqsu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】安心除劳治骨蒸，洗肝目多泪，口干心热，杀疳虫，治疣心痛，鼻衄，肠风下血，后急热肿痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105514-ueqg8ic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105514-ueqg8ic"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【东垣】泻伏火救肾水，治冲脉气逆，不渴而小便不通，诸疮痛不可忍。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105516-skypv6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105516-skypv6s"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【丹溪】得知母降阴火，得苍术除湿清热，为治痿要药，得细辛泻膀胱火，治口舌生疮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105518-4kpb80u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105518-4kpb80u"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】清热燥湿。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105519-7h22bho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105519-7h22bho"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105520-9d941v1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105520-9d941v1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】恶干漆，伏硫磺，阴阳两虚，脾胃薄弱者均忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105521-pcztxmt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105521-pcztxmt"}},{"ID":"20240122105521-8gh8fmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105521-8gh8fmi"}},{"ID":"20240122105521-i0vzal2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105521-i0vzal2","updated":"20240130092701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第101味药，檗木。又叫作黄柏，你这个檗木写上去人家还看不懂，你要叫黄柏。这个黄柏呢也在经方里面被张仲景选用的药。主五脏肠胃中结节黄疸，下利，黄柏用得非常多，尤其是小便痛，小便刺痛，那黄柏效果很好，膀胱的热，肾脏的热，肾脏有结石或者是痛，我们三黄汤，黄连黄芩黄柏。"}]},{"ID":"20240122105531-y8dbahs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105531-y8dbahs","updated":"20240130092742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄柏的使用非常的广，也叫作川柏，因为产在我国四川，四川最多，那这个药呢，味苦性寒，所以只要是寒凉药都可以解毒，都可以杀菌，都可以去热。所以黄柏呢是除热杀虫的药，坚肾益阴，它除了除热以外呢，可以滋阴，滋补的功能，所以黄柏呢是很好使用的，他这个颜色，那个树木拿起来劈下来，颜色就是黄的，鲜黄的，很亮。因为它是寒凉的药，性寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240122105539-emzs5qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105539-emzs5qi","updated":"20240130092951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你看甄权说，男子阴痿及茎上有生疮，生疮，还有妇女呢，那月经来的时候，下的一块一块像鸡肝一样的血块，还有湿热的热疮，通通可以使用，只要是热证，通通可以使用。朱丹溪呢他有讲这个跟知母啊跟苍术啊怎么搭配，怎么样子去，你比如说，为什么可以这样搭配？我举个例，比如说黄柏是去热的，苍术是祛湿的，所以湿热他都可以两个药，一个去热一个去湿，你就放在一起的话，那是不是可以除湿清热？那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"很多阳痿啊，就是湿热，就造成这样子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你可以用这个，诸如此类的，所以药物的选择呢就是看它的药性。所以说过去呢，这个南派他们用封髓丹，可以用黄柏，用甘草那，用砂仁啊把它配到，这个封髓封得住封不住？我告诉你封不住！你看我经方我封髓给你看，一封就封住了。那在封之前要把火点着再封。我们慢慢会介绍。这个黄柏我们经方在用的时候只是去热，去里热才使用，平常我们在封髓的时候不会用，那个力量不够。"}]}]}